      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83c\udfac Storyboard \u2192 Seedance 30s Pipeline (Scalable)\n\n## Architecture\n- 6 segments \u00d7 5s = 30s total\n- Daisy-chain continuity: last frame of segment N feeds into segment N+1 as `image_2`\n- Each segment uses ONE storyboard panel as primary reference (`image_1`)\n\n## Wiring\n- LoadImage \u2192 ImageGridCrop splits the board into panels\n- Panels 1-6 feed Segments 1-6 respectively\n- VideoLastFrame bridges between segments for character continuity\n- VideoConcat joins all 6 segments into final output\n\n## Prompts (copy into each Seedance node)\n**Seg1:** Panel 1 opening \u2014 tea ritual, warm light, melancholic mood.\n**Seg2:** Panel 2 stillness \u2014 contemplative pause, steam rising.\n**Seg3:** Panel 3 movement \u2014 lifting teapot, gentle push-in.\n**Seg4:** Panel 4 transition \u2014 holding cup, soft light.\n**Seg5:** Panel 5 atmosphere \u2014 close-up hands, warm tones.\n**Seg6:** Panel 6 ending \u2014 BOTANIKA bottle close-up, intimate.\n\n## Scalability\n- For 4\u00d74 grids: clone Segment Group, wire panels 7-10, add another VideoConcat layer\n- For 5\u00d75 grids: same pattern \u2014 just clone more groups\n- The daisy-chain structure never changes, only the count\n\n## Debug Overlay (post-process)\n```bash\nffmpeg -i output.mp4 -i storyboard.png -filter_complex \\\n  \"[1:v]scale=1280:360[board]; [0:v][board]vstack=inputs=2[out]\" \\\n  -map \"[out]\" debug.mp4\n```"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
